The instruction encodings in data/languages/TMS320C54x.slaspec are generated from
tools/c54x_encodings.py, transcribed by Ghidra-Rare from Texas Instruments' TMS320C54x DSP
Reference Set manuals (SPRU172C, Mnemonic Instruction Set; SPRU131G, CPU and Peripherals). The
manuals are not included (tools/fetch-ti-docs.sh downloads them). Earlier versions of this
extension took the encodings from the opcode table in GNU binutils (opcodes/tic54x-opc.c); that
table was not used for the current encodings. No binutils source code is included.
